## Integration & Connection Details (Optional)

Include this section **only if external services, libraries, or protocols are involved**.

| Service | Protocol | Library & Version | Auth Method |
|---------|---------|-------------------|-------------|
| {service} | REST / SSE / WebSocket / gRPC | {library name} | API Key / Basic Auth / Token |

Also include:
- Connection/initialization code pattern
- Example connection snippet if found in source

> ⚠️ If protocol or connection method is **NOT explicitly stated** in the source:
> mark as `[ASSUMED]` and note that verification is needed before implementation.
