## Implementation Requirements

List the **specific things the user needs to implement**, ordered by dependency:

- Each item should be **actionable and concrete**
- Group **related items together**
- Flag items that depend on **external decisions or unknowns**

<!-- ✅ [추가] MoSCoW 우선순위 분류 -->
Categorize each item by MoSCoW priority:

**Must Have** — required for the implementation to be considered complete

**Should Have** — important but not blocking; implement if straightforward

**Could Have** — nice to have; implement only if time permits

**Won't Have (this iteration)** — explicitly out of scope; do not implement
